// AWS RDS Snapshot Created  [tier: hunt]  ATT&CK: T1530
// Detects creation of RDS DB/cluster snapshots (CreateDBSnapshot/CreateDBClusterSnapshot). Attackers snapshot databases to collect data they…
// False positives: Backup automation and DBA workflows.
// Source: rules/collection/rds-create-db-snapshot.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
(eventName in~ ("CreateDBSnapshot", "CreateDBClusterSnapshot")) and eventSource =~ "rds.amazonaws.com"
